# Individual-level user study response data: kept local only, not pushed to
# the public repo, even redacted -- small-N personal-network recruitment
# makes re-identification from free-text writing style/background alone a
# real risk that goes beyond what "anonymised" in the PIS was scoped to
# cover. Only aggregate statistics (no per-response text) are tracked.
ethics/survey_data/raw/
ethics/survey_data/processed/*.csv
